## Title: Bagnon Extra
## Notes: Reddens locked lockboxes/chests, shows item charge counts, pink-tints gear you don't meet the requirement for, labels openable containers "OPN" and learnable mounts/pets/toys "LRN", and (Bagnonium only) tints unknown-profession recipes and class-restricted tokens blue.
